	)
	(text "DETECT: the bed's ID resistor against this 10k (BED_1..6 =\n2.2k..33k), a removal (> 55000), a bed node's touch (> 56000,\nrising, armed, \"trigger\": \"detect\"). GP11: the probe pulse (10 ms),\nonly as long as the OR gate is there."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "48f643af-56b0-409f-bcc4-c5c9da8a7b16")
	)
	(text "100 ms pulses: PWR_ON once a bed's ID reads steady,\nPWR_OFF when DETECT says \"no bed\" for 250 ms.\nIt turns itself on after a power cycle. VIN: the\nDock's 5 V? To confirm, and the switch's model."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
